{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require Motorway Services to provide physical security guards for truck parks",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We call on the Government to require any motorway services which has truck parking to provide physical security guards. A lot of freight crime happens at motorway service areas, where many drivers fear becoming a victim. We believe that providing security guards can improve driver welfare.",
